OL,3,ASaudi coalition strikes fuel depot near
OL,4,AYemen's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Saudi-led coalition fighting in
OL,7,FYemen has carried out a strike on fuel
OL,8,Fdepot near the Houthi-controlled
OL,9,Fcapital, Sanaa, its spokesperson says.
OL,11,FMaj Gen Turki al-Maliki accused the
OL,12,FHouthis of using the Yemen Petroleum
OL,13,FCompany's al-Sabaha facility to fuel
OL,14,Ftheir war effort, including by
OL,15,Fsupporting missile and drone attacks on
OL,16,FSaudi Arabia.
OL,18,FThe coalition earlier warned civilians
OL,19,Fto evacuate the site ahead of a
OL,20,F"special operation", with Houthi media
OL,21,Fsaying the facility had been struck
OL,22,Fbefore al-Maliki confirmed the strike.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
