OL,3,ASaudi coalition strikes fuel depot near
OL,4,AYemen's capital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis have warned they will
OL,7,Fretaliate by targeting the airport and
OL,8,FAramco refinery in Saudi Arabia's
OL,9,Fcapital, Riyadh, and Aramco's
OL,10,Fheadquarters in the eastern city of
OL,11,FDammam.
